           'To: testuser@example.com\n'
           'Subject: Your Netflix Account Has Been Compromised\n')
body = """Hi testuser,\n\nYour Netflix account has been compromised. Please click the link to log in securely: http://localhost:5000/login."""

# Send the email
smtp.sendmail(to_email, headers + body)
smtp.quit()
```

