Your account has been flagged for suspicious activity. To verify your account, please click the link below:

https://localhost:5000

If you didn't authorize this, your account may be at risk. Please take immediate action.

Best regards,
Netflix Security Team'''

    server = SMTP('smtp.example.com', 587)
